# Git workflow (sample-listing-tracker)

Remote: `https://github.com/snorlaxkaran/listing-tba.git` (branch `main`).

After meaningful changes are implemented and build passes:

1. `git add` relevant files (never commit `.env` or secrets).
2. `git commit` with a clear message.
3. `git push origin main` so Vercel deploys **listing-tba**.

Do not ask whether to push unless the user says to hold off. Do not force-push `main`.
